      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day her husband brought lunch for her to eat, and just put down the lunch and left without saying anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "新来的男同事问：“刚才那个人是谁呀？”",
