    "sentence_translations": [
      "Delivering Food",
      "",
      "At our company we have a beautiful female colleague.",
      "One day her husband brought lunch for her to eat, and just put down the lunch and left without saying anything.",
      "",
      "A male colleague who was a newcomer asked: “Who was that just now?”",
      "",
      "The female colleague answered: “A delivery guy.”",
      "",
      "The male colleague asked: “How come you didn't give him any money?”",
      "",
      "The female colleague responded: “I don't have to, I just have to go to bed with him tonight.”",
      "",
      "The male colleague didn't say anything.",
      "",
      "The next day, this male colleague also brought lunch for her to eat, and everyone in the office burst out laughing."
    ]
